{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":27495,"name":"LCL","username":"LusoCryptoLabs","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/talk.nervos.org/lusocryptolabs/{size}/11500_2.png","created_at":"2026-11-17T14:35:26.243Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eSince 2023, 178 people have voted in the Community Fund DAO, about 1% of the 16,610 Nervos DAO depositors. We wanted to understand why more holders do not take part, and found one reason that can be fixed: 1,132 depositors can only vote if they move their deposit to Neuron first, because the wallet they use cannot bind today. Other reasons need asking, so there is a short poll at the end.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRead from CKB mainnet at block 21,038,015 and from Metaforo’s public API, both on 2026-11-17, read only. We build Ward and the Cellula wallet and had a proposal in this DAO (t/11089, passed on 16 November), so we waited for its vote to close before posting this. The scripts and raw data are available to anyone who wants to check them.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-27495-how-a-vote-is-counted-today-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-27495-how-a-vote-is-counted-today-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eHow a vote is counted today\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMetaforo binds a CKB address with a message signed the way Neuron signs (secp256k1), which is how most people held CKB when the DAO started. A vote weighs the Nervos DAO deposits under the bound addresses. All 614 addresses bound by the 178 people who have ever voted are secp256k1 addresses. Logging in with JoyID works, but deposits under the JoyID address are not counted.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-27495-h-1-who-votes-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-27495-h-1-who-votes-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e1. Who votes\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e39 votes since February 2023. The median vote had 15 voters and 1.2% of the DAO’s deposits on its closing day (94.0M CKB; 155.0M over the last 12 months). The highest were 50 voters (Rosen Bridge integration, January 2026) and 7.3% of deposits (Community Fund DAO v1.1, November 2025).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e178 people have ever voted, 81 of them in the last 12 months. The addresses voters bound hold 980.0M CKB in deposits today, 12.0% of the DAO.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-27495-h-2-who-cannot-vote-from-their-own-wallet-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-27495-h-2-who-cannot-vote-from-their-own-wallet-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e2. Who cannot vote from their own wallet\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLive Nervos DAO deposits: 8,179,234,336 CKB under 16,610 locks (the explorer shows the same two numbers). By the lock that holds them:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"md-table\"\u003e\n\u003ctable\u003e\n\u003cthead\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eLock\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"text-align:right\"\u003eDepositors\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"text-align:right\"\u003eCKB in deposits\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"text-align:right\"\u003eShare\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/thead\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003esecp256k1 (Neuron and most wallets)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e15,478\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e7,789,223,487\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e95.23%\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eJoyID\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e120\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e171,535,773\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e2.10%\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ePW-lock (Portal Wallet)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e926\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e159,203,037\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e1.95%\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eOmnilock, Ethereum mode (MetaMask through CCC)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e78\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e39,562,830\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e0.48%\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eQuantum-resistant lock (Quantum Purse)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e5\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e15,310,092\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e0.19%\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eiCKB pool\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e1\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e2,857,481\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e0.03%\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eOmnilock, Bitcoin mode (UniSat, OKX through CCC)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e1\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e1,483,000\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e0.02%\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eother\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e1\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e58,636\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\"\u003e0.00%\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp\u003eDeposits outside secp256k1 cannot be bound today: 1,132 depositors with 390.0M CKB (4.8%). Portal Wallet had a path in 2023 (t/7053), but none of the 614 bound addresses is a PW-lock. Leaving PW-lock aside, it is 206 depositors with 230.8M CKB (2.8%). Some voters already log in with JoyID; deposits under their JoyID addresses are not counted today.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese wallets use the DAO more than most: JoyID holders keep 37% of their CKB in deposits, PW-lock 56%, Omnilock 31%, the quantum-resistant lock 49%. For secp256k1 addresses it is about 16% (approximate, see the limits).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe wallet is not the main reason people do not vote: about 15,000 depositors can bind today and have not. Why, the chain cannot say.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-27495-h-3-the-30-day-lock-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-27495-h-3-the-30-day-lock-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e3. The 30 day lock\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight needs the CKB in the DAO, and leaving it takes up to about 30 days. How many holders stay out for that reason, the chain cannot tell either: most of the CKB outside the DAO (about 41.7B) sits with exchanges, team and foundation addresses. 843.2M CKB is in phase 1 of a withdrawal right now.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-27495-counting-any-wallet-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-27495-counting-any-wallet-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eCounting any wallet\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCounting deposits from any lock would let the 1,132 depositors above vote from the wallet they already use. One way is a lock proof, which we have been building as Ward (\u003ca href=\"https://github.com/LusoCryptoLabs/ckb-ward\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eGitHub - LusoCryptoLabs/ckb-ward: Ward: lock proof for CKB. Prove control of any CKB lock with a proof transaction that can never land on chain. · GitHub\u003c/a\u003e); votes signed by the deposit’s own lock, as in ckb-treasury-lab, are another. We are happy to help with either.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-27495-if-you-hold-ckb-and-have-not-voted-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-27495-if-you-hold-ckb-and-have-not-voted-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eIf you hold CKB and have not voted\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat is the main reason?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"poll\" data-poll-charttype=\"bar\" data-poll-name=\"poll\" data-poll-public=\"false\" data-poll-results=\"always\" data-poll-status=\"open\" data-poll-type=\"regular\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"poll-container\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli data-poll-option-id=\"42789a0bb7a4c3992587dce98a3f99ac\"\u003eI did not know about these votes\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-poll-option-id=\"eb4ee706e6c4e98de0ebd6b0aeef206d\"\u003eMy wallet cannot bind (JoyID, MetaMask, UniSat, OKX, other)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-poll-option-id=\"60ab455361fe890b074b328fa07f10b7\"\u003eBinding and voting take too much effort\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-poll-option-id=\"c1b493c52301db254ab8814e675fa984\"\u003eMy CKB is on an exchange\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-poll-option-id=\"ef32594e932229557ce274994aed7d95\"\u003eI do not want it locked in the Nervos DAO\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-poll-option-id=\"71fe5cf2ea2fa82b37305d1189096903\"\u003eMy vote would not change the result\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-poll-option-id=\"fa5489fe436b1386424e8ca78ce16d85\"\u003eOther (please reply)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"poll-info\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"poll-info_counts\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"poll-info_counts-count\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"info-number\"\u003e0\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"info-label\"\u003evoters\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-27495-method-and-limits-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-27495-method-and-limits-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eMethod and limits\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDeposits: every live cell with the Nervos DAO type at block 21,038,015 (indexer \u003ccode\u003eget_cells\u003c/code\u003e); data of 8 zero bytes is a deposit, anything else a withdrawal in progress.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLock kinds from CCC’s list of mainnet scripts; the Omnilock mode from the first byte of its args; the quantum-resistant lock and iCKB identified by code hash.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVotes, bound addresses, login keys and each voter’s weight from Metaforo’s public API (39 polls, 178 voter profiles). Shares use the explorer’s daily DAO total on each closing day.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eA depositor here is a distinct lock. One person can hold several, and an exchange can hold many people’s CKB under one. Large voters are not identified.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe total held by secp256k1 addresses is circulating supply less the other lock families, because the public indexer timed out adding up every secp256k1 cell. That makes the 16% approximate.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":6,"updated_at":"2026-11-17T14:47:24.475Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":7,"reads":32,"readers_count":31,"score":146.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":11246,"topic_slug":"community-fund-dao-voting-in-numbers","display_username":"LCL","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://github.com/LusoCryptoLabs/ckb-ward","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"GitHub - LusoCryptoLabs/ckb-ward: Ward: lock proof for CKB. Prove control of any CKB lock with a proof transaction that can never land on chain. · GitHub","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":3}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":4356,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":"Softer wording; voting needs a move to Neuron, not impossible","can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/community-fund-dao-voting-in-numbers/11246/1","babel_translations_meta":[{"language":"es","status":"completed","source_language":"en"},{"language":"zh-cn","status":"completed","source_language":"en"}],"show_translation_widget":true,"show_translation_button":true,"babel_detected_locale":"en","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":3}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":3,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false,"can_translate":false,"polls":[{"id":8,"name":"poll","type":"regular","status":"open","dynamic":false,"results":"always","options":[{"id":"42789a0bb7a4c3992587dce98a3f99ac","html":"I did not know about these votes","votes":0},{"id":"eb4ee706e6c4e98de0ebd6b0aeef206d","html":"My wallet cannot bind (JoyID, MetaMask, UniSat, OKX, other)","votes":3},{"id":"60ab455361fe890b074b328fa07f10b7","html":"Binding and voting take too much effort","votes":2},{"id":"c1b493c52301db254ab8814e675fa984","html":"My CKB is on an exchange","votes":2},{"id":"ef32594e932229557ce274994aed7d95","html":"I do not want it locked in the Nervos DAO","votes":0},{"id":"71fe5cf2ea2fa82b37305d1189096903","html":"My vote would not change the result","votes":1},{"id":"fa5489fe436b1386424e8ca78ce16d85","html":"Other (please reply)","votes":1}],"voters":9,"chart_type":"bar","title":null,"closed_at":null,"closed_by":null}]},{"id":27562,"name":"","username":"Ophiuchus","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/talk.nervos.org/ophiuchus/{size}/10374_2.png","created_at":"2026-11-18T18:53:33.152Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eReally interesting topic and definitely an important one for Nervos.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePersonally, I think the problem isn’t necessarily that people don’t care about voting. A lot of CKB holders probably don’t even know these votes are happening, or how to participate.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMaybe we should focus more on making voting easier and giving proposals more visibility. Even a simple notification when a new vote is open could make a difference.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThanks for bringing this up, I think it’s something the community really needs to discuss more.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":2,"post_type":1,"posts_count":6,"updated_at":"2026-11-18T18:53:33.152Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":21,"readers_count":20,"score":19.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":11246,"topic_slug":"community-fund-dao-voting-in-numbers","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":4130,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/community-fund-dao-voting-in-numbers/11246/2","babel_translations_meta":[{"language":"es","status":"completed","source_language":"en"},{"language":"zh-cn","status":"completed","source_language":"en"}],"show_translation_widget":true,"show_translation_button":true,"babel_detected_locale":"en","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_translate":false},{"id":27572,"name":"Thinker","username":"Thinker","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/talk.nervos.org/thinker/{size}/3914_2.png","created_at":"2026-11-19T04:46:13.086Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e大概分析下我了解到投票少的原因，可能由主到次（不完全）\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1.社区缺失讨论气氛：除了资助和技术贴，其他问题都很少有人回应，这里缺少志同道合及讨论环境，从而不关心社区。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e2.投票有些麻烦：存入DAO是投票前提，但存入DAO的人是短期不想动的人，不想因为投票而降低安全而触网。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e3.改变不了什么：在1的环境下，感觉自己的一点点票改变不了什么结果（第1条能好转，这里也许会有变化）。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e4.CKB价格跌去太多：相对自己总资产来说占比很低，对社区不再关心。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e5.我只要我的：自己利益和生态利益没有捆绑，生态发展起来了 对我更好，生态没有起来，我已经拿到我该拿到的了，我很忙。\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":3,"post_type":1,"posts_count":6,"updated_at":"2026-11-19T04:48:36.349Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":21,"readers_count":20,"score":79.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":11246,"topic_slug":"community-fund-dao-voting-in-numbers","display_username":"Thinker","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":3}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":1689,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/community-fund-dao-voting-in-numbers/11246/3","babel_translations_meta":[{"language":"en","status":"failed","source_language":null},{"language":"es","status":"failed","source_language":null}],"show_translation_widget":true,"show_translation_button":true,"babel_detected_locale":"zh-cn","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":3}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":3,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_translate":false},{"id":27573,"name":"Long Tran","username":"longdevbf","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/talk.nervos.org/longdevbf/{size}/11873_2.png","created_at":"2026-11-19T04:57:53.926Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHas CKB published a series of guides on how to use CKB’s platforms? I think it would be easier if holders had guidance and what the benefits of joining the platform were. I think that will solve this problem as well as future liquidity.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":4,"post_type":1,"posts_count":6,"updated_at":"2026-11-19T04:57:53.926Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":20,"readers_count":19,"score":24.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":11246,"topic_slug":"community-fund-dao-voting-in-numbers","display_username":"Long Tran","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":4446,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/community-fund-dao-voting-in-numbers/11246/4","babel_translations_meta":[{"language":"es","status":"completed","source_language":"en"},{"language":"zh-cn","status":"completed","source_language":"en"}],"show_translation_widget":true,"show_translation_button":true,"babel_detected_locale":"en","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_translate":false},{"id":27580,"name":"zz_tovarishch","username":"zz_tovarishch","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/talk.nervos.org/zz_tovarishch/{size}/8925_2.png","created_at":"2026-11-19T10:20:18.290Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003elongdevbf您好，您可以在这里找到目前DAO的规则\u003c/p\u003e\u003caside class=\"quote quote-modified\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"6874\"\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"quote-controls\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cimg alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/user_avatar/talk.nervos.org/jackylhh/48/9804_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"quote-title__text-content\"\u003e\n      \u003ca href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/t/ckb-community-fund-dao-rules-and-process/6874\"\u003eCKB Community Fund DAO Rules and Process\u003c/a\u003e \u003ca class=\"badge-category__wrapper \" href=\"/c/daos-funding/ckb-community-fund-dao/65\"\u003e\u003cspan data-category-id=\"65\" style=\"--category-badge-color: #12A89D; --category-badge-text-color: #FFFFFF; --parent-category-badge-color: #F39C12;\" data-parent-category-id=\"73\" data-drop-close=\"true\" class=\"badge-category --style-square --has-parent\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"badge-category__name\"\u003eCKB Community Fund DAO\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003cblockquote\u003e\n    Source: \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/CKB-Community-Fund-DAO/rules/blob/main/rules-en.md\"\u003eCKB Community Fund DAO Rules and Process\u003c/a\u003e \n\n\u003ca name=\"p-14357-scope-of-governance-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-14357-scope-of-governance-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScope of Governance\nThe CKB Community Fund DAO is a community fund initiated by the Nervos community and jointly contributed by the community and the Nervos Foundation to fund community members to do various things around the CKB L1 ecosystem, such as code development, event organization, content production etc. \nThe CKB Community Fund DAO (hereinafter referred to as DAO) has an initial holding of 276,000,000 CKBs. \nTwo types of governance: \n\nT…\n  \u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e在这里找到如何使用metaforo平台\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://dao.ckb.community/thread/how-to-bind-your-nervos-dao-address-on-metaforo-and-vote-on-proposals-41913\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003ehttps://dao.ckb.community/thread/how-to-bind-your-nervos-dao-address-on-metaforo-and-vote-on-proposals-41913\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e他们都置顶在metaforo的首页\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e希望能为您参与DAO治理有所帮助\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBest,\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":6,"updated_at":"2026-11-19T10:20:18.290Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":4,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":20,"readers_count":19,"score":34.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":11246,"topic_slug":"community-fund-dao-voting-in-numbers","display_username":"zz_tovarishch","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://talk.nervos.org/t/ckb-community-fund-dao-rules-and-process/6874","internal":true,"reflection":false,"title":"CKB Community Fund DAO Rules and Process","clicks":0},{"url":"https://dao.ckb.community/thread/how-to-bind-your-nervos-dao-address-on-metaforo-and-vote-on-proposals-41913","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":"","reply_to_user":{"id":4446,"username":"longdevbf","name":"Long Tran","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/talk.nervos.org/longdevbf/{size}/11873_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":2}],"moderator":true,"admin":false,"staff":true,"user_id":3420,"hidden":false,"trust_level":3,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/community-fund-dao-voting-in-numbers/11246/5","babel_translations_meta":[{"language":"en","status":"completed","source_language":"zh-cn"},{"language":"es","status":"completed","source_language":"zh-cn"}],"show_translation_widget":true,"show_translation_button":true,"babel_detected_locale":"zh-cn","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":2}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":2,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted